# All pre-seeded portal accounts:
# ┌─────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┬────────────────────┬──────────────────────┐
# │ Role                │ Email                        │ Password           │ Access               │
# ├─────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┼────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
# │ Super Admin         │ admin@ganga-maxx.com         │ Pranav@123         │ Full Access          │
# │ Sales Admin         │ salesadmin@ganga-maxx.com    │ salesadmin@123     │ Full Access          │
# │ Salesman            │ salesman@ganga-maxx.com      │ salesman@123       │ Customer Data        │
# │ Warehouse Staff     │ warehouse@ganga-maxx.com     │ warehouse@123      │ Inventory            │
# │ Accounts Manager    │ accounts@ganga-maxx.com      │ accounts@123       │ Payments             │
# │ Compliance Admin    │ compliance@ganga-maxx.com    │ compliance@123     │ Compliance Reports   │
# │ Dealer              │ dealer@ganga-maxx.com        │ dealer@123         │ Bulk Orders          │
# │ Facility Manager    │ manager@ganga-maxx.com       │ manager@123        │ Requirements Form    │
